# dsh-everything-claude-code

This bundle adapts [WorldFlowAI/everything-claude-code](https://github.com/WorldFlowAI/everything-claude-code)
(ECC) for the DeepSeek Harness (DSH).

## Upstream

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| Source | `https://github.com/WorldFlowAI/everything-claude-code` |
| License | MIT |
| Author | Affaan Mustafa |
| Fetched via | `https://gh-proxy.com/` (direct GitHub is unreachable on the authoring host) |

ECC is itself a fork/derivative of `affaan-m/everything-claude-code`.

## What was reused

Reused with adaptation: the 11 `skills/*/SKILL.md` bodies, the 8 `rules/*.md`,
the 15 `commands/*.md`, the 9 `agents/*.md`, and the `contexts/*.md` files.
Their text is preserved; additions are limited to (a) `name`/`description`
frontmatter required by `dsh-skill-filesystem`, and (b) a leading note on each
resource file explaining how it is used under DSH.

## What is original to this repository

- `index.js`, `client.js` — the Host and Client halves of the DSH bundle.
- `hooks/hooks.json` and `hooks/scripts/*.mjs` — the hook set, rewritten so the
  matchers name DSH tools and blocking uses the channel this bridge honors.
- `presets/everything-claude-code.patch.yml` — the agent preset.
- `scripts/adapt-*.mjs` — the idempotent adapters that produced the above.
- `tests/*` — the test suites.

## Changes made to upstream material

- Tool names in the adapted text were mapped to DSH equivalents where they were
  machine-readable (backticked names and `tools:` lists).
- The `PreCompact` and `SessionEnd` hooks were **not** ported: the DSH hook
  bridge does not support those events, so ECC's memory-persistence behavior is
  not reproduced. This is a functional gap, stated in the README.
- The original dev-server hook blocked with exit code 2; that channel does not
  block in DSH `0.2.0-rc.2`, so blocking now uses
  `hookSpecificOutput.permissionDecision`.

